  "<a href=\"/news/2026/08/omacom-foundation-to-be-exclusive-hyprland-sponsor/\">Read the announcement</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://hypr.land/\">Hyprland</a> by <a href=\"https://x.com/vaxryy\">Vaxry</a>": "<a href=\"/news/2026/08/omacom-foundation-to-be-exclusive-hyprland-sponsor/\">閱讀公告</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://hypr.land/\">Hyprland</a>，作者 <a href=\"https://x.com/vaxryy\">Vaxry</a>",
  "<a href=\"/news/2026/08/omacom-foundation-to-be-premier-mise-sponsor/\">Read the announcement</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://mise.jdx.dev/\">mise</a> by <a href=\"https://x.com/jdxcode\">jdx</a>": "<a href=\"/news/2026/08/omacom-foundation-to-be-premier-mise-sponsor/\">閱讀公告</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://mise.jdx.dev/\">mise</a>，作者 <a href=\"https://x.com/jdxcode\">jdx</a>",
  "<a href=\"/news/2026/08/omacom-foundation-to-be-premier-quickshell-sponsor/\">Read the announcement</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://quickshell.org/\">Quickshell</a> by <a href=\"https://x.com/outfoxxedd\">outfoxxed</a>": "<a href=\"/news/2026/08/omacom-foundation-to-be-premier-quickshell-sponsor/\">閱讀公告</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://quickshell.org/\">Quickshell</a>，作者 <a href=\"https://x.com/outfoxxedd\">outfoxxed</a>",
  "Logo": "標誌",
  "<a href=\"/news/2026/09/omacom-foundation-hires-outfoxxed/\">Read the announcement</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://quickshell.org/\">Quickshell</a> by <a href=\"https://x.com/outfoxxedd\">outfoxxed</a>": "<a href=\"/news/2026/09/omacom-foundation-hires-outfoxxed/\">讀公告</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://quickshell.org/\">Quickshell</a>，作者 <a href=\"https://x.com/outfoxxedd\">outfoxxed</a>",
  "Full-time Omacom Foundation employee": "Omacom Foundation 全職員工",
  "Head of Omarchy Kernel": "Omarchy Kernel 負責人",
  "Head of Omarchy Shell": "Omarchy Shell 負責人",
  "Krzysztof co-maintains key parts of Linux&rsquo;s PCI subsystem. His work helps the kernel communicate with modern hardware, from graphics cards to fast storage. He leads Omarchy Kernel performance, compatibility, and security, and serves on <a href=\"/teams/#core\">Omarchy Core</a>.": "Krzysztof 共同維護 Linux PCI 子系統的關鍵部分。他的工作讓核心跟得上現代硬體，從顯示卡到高速儲存都是。他領導 Omarchy Kernel 的效能、相容性與安全，也是 <a href=\"/teams/#core\">Omarchy Core</a> 的成員。",
  "Multi-year sponsorships for the projects Omarchy is built on - Hyprland and mise - so the people behind them can work without thinking about fundraising.": "對 Omarchy 賴以建立的專案——Hyprland 和 mise——提供多年期贊助，讓背後的人不必為籌款分心。",
  "Quickshell is the desktop construction kit behind Omarchy Shell. It provides the building blocks for bars, menus, notifications, widgets, and lock screens, using QML to turn ideas into interfaces that update as you work. That flexibility lets people and their agents build plugins and shape the desktop around their needs. Its creator, outfoxxed, is a full-time Omacom Foundation employee as Head of Omarchy Shell and a member of Omarchy Core, working to make the shell and its foundations faster, more reliable, and easier to extend.": "Quickshell 是 Omarchy Shell 底下那套桌面組裝工具箱。狀態列、選單、通知、小工具和鎖定畫面的材料都由它提供，用 QML 把想法變成會隨著你工作而變的介面。有這種彈性，人和他們的 Agent 才能做外掛、把桌面調成自己需要的樣子。它的作者 outfoxxed 是 Omacom Foundation 的全職員工，擔任 Omarchy Shell 負責人，也是 Omarchy Core 成員，正在讓 shell 和它的地基更快、更可靠、更好擴充。",
  "Staff": "專職團隊",
  "The Omacom Foundation employees working full time on Omarchy.": "全職投入 Omarchy 的 Omacom Foundation 員工。",
  "The full-time employees of the Omacom Foundation, paid for by <a href=\"/patrons/\">our patrons</a> to make Omarchy better for everyone.": "Omacom Foundation 的全職員工，由<a href=\"/patrons/\">贊助人</a>出錢，把 Omarchy 做得對每個人都更好。",
  "outfoxxed created <a href=\"https://quickshell.org/\">Quickshell</a>, the toolkit behind Omarchy Shell. He makes the desktop faster, more reliable, and easier for people and agents to extend through plugins. He also serves on <a href=\"/teams/#core\">Omarchy Core</a>.": "outfoxxed 做了 <a href=\"https://quickshell.org/\">Quickshell</a>，也就是 Omarchy Shell 底下那套工具箱。他讓桌面更快、更可靠，也讓人和 Agent 更容易用外掛去擴充它。他也是 <a href=\"/teams/#core\">Omarchy Core</a> 的成員。",
  "The people and companies funding the development, maintenance, and spread of Omarchy.": "資助 Omarchy 開發、維護與推廣的個人與企業。",
  "<a href=\"#beauty-is-truth\">Beauty is truth</a>": "<a href=\"#beauty-is-truth\">美即真理</a>",
  "<a href=\"#command-is-service\">Command is service</a>": "<a href=\"#command-is-service\">統御即服務</a>",
  "<a href=\"#have-some-fun\">Have some fun</a>": "<a href=\"#have-some-fun\">保持玩心</a>",
  "<a href=\"#heritage-is-duty\">Heritage is duty</a>": "<a href=\"#heritage-is-duty\">傳承即使命</a>",
  "<a href=\"#hold-the-line\">Hold the line</a>": "<a href=\"#hold-the-line\">堅守底線</a>",
  "<a href=\"#own-the-machine\">Own the machine</a>": "<a href=\"#own-the-machine\">全面接管</a>",
  "<a href=\"#perfect-the-computer\">Perfect the computer</a>": "<a href=\"#perfect-the-computer\">打造完美電腦</a>",
  "<a href=\"#unite-the-nerds\">Unite the nerds</a>": "<a href=\"#unite-the-nerds\">集結技術宅</a>",
  "<a href=\"#welcome-the-agents\">Welcome the agents</a>": "<a href=\"#welcome-the-agents\">擁抱 Agent</a>",
  "<a href=\"#youre-somebody-now\">You&#39;re somebody now</a>": "<a href=\"#youre-somebody-now\">你也是號人物了</a>",
  "Excellence is not born out of committee, and Omarchy is not a democracy. It&#39;s a benevolent dictatorship in the grand tradition of Linux, Ruby, and Rails. The dictator&#39;s job is to listen to everyone, but make the call according to their intuition, vision, and experience. Some calls will be wrong, and then they&#39;ll be reverted. Others will be delegated. But the buck will always have a place to stop.": "委員會催生不出卓越，Omarchy 更不是什麼民主制。它承襲了 Linux、Ruby 與 Rails 的榮耀血脈，選擇成為「仁慈的獨裁」。而統御者的職責是傾聽所有人的聲音，但最終憑藉自身的直覺、願景與經驗來拍板定案。其中可能有些決策會出錯，但屆時再撤回即可。也有些任務會授權下放，但無論如何，最終的責任永遠有人一肩扛起。",
  "Great tools are beautiful because they&#39;re right. The best curve of the blade is also the elegant one, so let&#39;s nail the sharp lines of that TUI, get those corner radii right, and polish the CLIs. The colors should be coordinated. The padding should be just so. There&#39;s enough desaturated brutalism in this world already. Make it shine, make it wow, make it art.": "優秀的工具之所以美，是因為它們生來就正確。就像最鋒利的刀刃，往往也擁有最優雅的弧線。所以，就讓我們耗盡心力搞定 TUI 的俐落線條，把圓角調到最正確的比例，並將 CLI 打磨到極致。除此之外，色彩也必須和諧呼應，留白必須分毫不差。這世界的低飽和粗獷風已經夠多了。我們偏要讓作品閃耀，讓它驚豔，讓它昇華為藝術。",
  "Omarchy is for everyone willing to learn and participate. From <a href=\"https://oligarchy.fyi\">billionaires</a> to anons on X. From <a href=\"/staff\">staff engineers</a> to script kiddies. From <a href=\"https://omarchy.cn\">China</a> to Malibu. Show up, fix something, or just spread the enthusiasm. <a href=\"https://x.com/dhh/status/2097747649625497874\">You&#39;re somebody now</a>.": "Omarchy 敞開大門，歡迎所有願意學習與參與的人。無論你是 <a href=\"https://oligarchy.fyi\">億萬富翁</a> 還是 X 上的匿名帳號；是 <a href=\"/staff\">頂尖的主任工程師</a> 還是剛入門的小菜鳥。無論你身在 <a href=\"https://omarchy.cn\">中國</a> 還是加州馬里布。只要你站出來、解決了某個問題，或只是單純幫忙把這把火燒得更旺。那麼，<a href=\"https://x.com/dhh/status/2097747649625497874\">你也是這圈子裡的一號人物了</a>。",
  "The Perfect Computer may start as omakase, but it&#39;s ultimately yours. Fully and completely. No tollbooths, no gatekeepers, no platforms that can change the terms on you. Just free and open code that you can turn into whatever you desire. The malleable machine of the future is here today and it&#39;s yours to own.": "一台完美的電腦，或許始於我們為你精心準備的這套「主廚做主」（omakase），但它終究是你的機器，自始至終都只屬於你。因此這裡不收過路費，也沒有守門人，更沒有那些動不動就強迫你接受的條款變更。只有純粹且自由的程式碼，讓你愛怎麼捏就怎麼捏。這部能隨心重塑的次世代機器現在就在你手上，等著你來全面接管。",
  "The age of agents is the most important paradigm shift in computing since the microprocessor, and Omarchy is going to take full advantage. Agents are welcome everywhere. In the code, in the issues, in the pull requests, and in the infrastructure. We&#39;re going to lean all the way in, put the new intelligence to work all over, and together <a href=\"https://wecanfixeverything.com\">We Can Fix Everything</a>!": "Agent 時代的來臨，是自微處理器問世以來，運算領域最重要的一次典範轉移。而 Omarchy 準備好要將其發揮到極致。在這裡，Agent 無所不在：無論是寫 code、處理 Issue、發 PR（Pull Request），還是管理基礎設施，我們都張開雙手歡迎。我們將全面擁抱這項技術，讓這股新的力量出現在每一個角落。大家一起上，有了它，<a href=\"https://wecanfixeverything.com\">我們能修好一切</a>！",
  "The modern history of computers is barely a lifetime old, but its heritage is rich and deserves our respect. It&#39;s our duty to honor those who forged the path before us. From <a href=\"https://github.com/omacom/omarchy/pull/10307\">shipping basic vi</a> fifty years after Bill Joy wrote the first version to dedicating a <a href=\"https://github.com/dhh/omarchy-giants-theme\">theme to von Neumann</a>. We should be proud of how we got here and make our ancestors smile from retirement or above.": "現代電腦的發展史也才不過人類一輩子的時間，但其留下的底蘊卻無比豐厚，值得我們獻上敬意。而向那些在前方開闢疆土的先驅們致敬，是我們的使命。從 Bill Joy 寫下第一版程式碼的五十年後，我們依然堅持在系統 <a href=\"https://github.com/omacom/omarchy/pull/10307\">內建最基礎的 vi</a>，到專門為馮·紐曼（von Neumann）設計一款 <a href=\"https://github.com/dhh/omarchy-giants-theme\">專屬的佈景主題</a>。我們應該為自己如何走到今天而自豪，讓祖師爺們在退休中或在天上露出微笑。",
  "The original hacker cred was all about the code. It didn&#39;t care who you were, what your background was, or even if you were legally old enough to operate a <a href=\"https://x.com/dhh/status/2096542976683970838\">three-node elite BBS out of your bedroom</a>. It just cared about the work, the art, the dare. Omarchy is bringing that ethos back, and dropping the Code-of-Conduct struggle sessions and identity-overload nonsense that has plagued open source for far too long. We&#39;re done with all of it. Just be nice and sincere.": "最初駭客的江湖地位只取決於程式碼。不管你是誰、背景多硬，或者是否已經到了 <a href=\"https://x.com/dhh/status/2096542976683970838\">能在自己房間裡架設三節點菁英 BBS 站</a> 的法定年齡。只要拿得出實作的成果、純粹的藝術，以及挑戰極限的膽識，這樣就夠了。Omarchy 要找回這種風骨，並澈底拋棄那些荼毒開源圈已久的「行為準則（CoC）」批鬥大會，以及身分認同過載的無稽之談。我們受夠這一切了，大家只要保持友善，拿出真誠就好。",
  "There are amazing nerds everywhere. Cracked teenagers. Wise neckbeards. Obsessive people with jagged opinions and incredible talent. But we&#39;re spread across a thousand little fiefdoms, accomplishing a fraction of what we could together. Omarchy is a rallying cry to unite that talent behind a common goal: Make Linux win the desktop, as the prophecy foretold.": "大神無處不在，無論是實力破表的天才少年、歷經風霜的上古神人，還是那些固執己見卻才華洋溢的偏執狂。但如今，我們卻散落在無數個小山頭裡各自為王，能成就的偉業不及聯手時的九牛一毛。Omarchy 就是一聲吹響集結的戰吼，誓言將這些天賦凝聚在同一個目標之下：讓 Linux 稱霸桌面，實現那古老的預言。",
  "There&#39;s no paper cut too small, no incompatibility too difficult, and no partnership that&#39;s out of reach. Omarchy&#39;s mission is nothing less than <em>The Perfect Computer</em>. That means <a href=\"https://x.com/mitchellh/status/2074225453217505494\">the pursuit of excellence without justification</a>. Everything should be faster, better, prettier. We can do all of it, at the same time, and be done before ASI.": "再微小的瑕疵都不該妥協，再難搞的相容性也得克服，沒有什麼合作是談不下來的。Omarchy 的使命不為別的，就是要打造出「完美的電腦」。這意味著 <a href=\"https://x.com/mitchellh/status/2074225453217505494\">我們追求卓越，不需任何理由</a>。一切都要更快、更好、更美。我們能同時達成這一切目標，而且還能在 ASI 統治世界前完工。",
  "We&#39;re serious people, doing serious work, but if we can&#39;t laugh at ourselves and the delusional mission, it gets stuffy and stale real quick. We need fun, we need whimsy, we need cool for its own sake. The computer needs easter eggs, it needs silly games, it needs <a href=\"https://radio.omarchy.org\">funny pun songs</a>. Serious people have serious fun.": "說真的，我們是一群腳踏實地，認真做事的老實人。但如果連我們都無法拿自己跟這個近乎妄想的任務開開玩笑，那氣氛鐵定一下就冷掉了。我們需要樂趣，需要天馬行空的狂想，更需要單純因為「酷」就動手的浪漫。因此這台電腦需要彩蛋，需要白爛的小遊戲，還要有 <a href=\"https://radio.omarchy.org\">充滿諧音梗的搞笑歌曲</a>。畢竟老實人瘋起來，比誰都還要認真。"
}
